WEBVTT

01:36.520 --> 01:39.960
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.100 --> 01:42.030
[Episode 32]

01:43.140 --> 01:52.800
[Warm Congratulations on Bee (Haidian)
Achieving Over 50% Market Share!]

01:45.070 --> 01:46.430
Congratulations, everyone!

01:47.310 --> 01:49.200
Under Mr. Xie's leadership,

01:49.870 --> 01:53.229
we've created another miracle for Bee.

01:54.870 --> 01:57.440
Tonight, let's cut to the chase

01:57.560 --> 01:58.840
and get straight to the bonuses!

01:58.840 --> 02:00.840
Great!

02:00.840 --> 02:03.750
Mr. Meng! Mr. Meng! Mr. Meng!

02:03.770 --> 02:06.050
Mr. Meng! Mr. Meng! Mr. Meng!

02:06.070 --> 02:08.190
Mr. Meng! Mr. Meng! Mr. Meng!

02:08.240 --> 02:10.400
Let's enjoy the fruits of our victory!

02:10.400 --> 02:13.160
Mr. Meng! Mr. Meng! Mr. Meng!

02:11.520 --> 02:12.530
[Warm Congratulations on Bee (Haidian)
Achieving Over 50% Market Share!]

02:13.170 --> 02:17.760
Mr. Meng! Mr. Meng! Mr. Meng!

02:20.870 --> 02:22.630
Come on, come on.

02:24.420 --> 02:26.050
This is just the beginning.

02:26.470 --> 02:27.370
Next,

02:27.470 --> 02:29.680
we'll take down Yuntu completely!

02:29.680 --> 02:30.430
Come on.

02:32.310 --> 02:33.960
From now on, I'll walk with my head held high

02:33.960 --> 02:35.460
in the food delivery industry!

02:39.400 --> 02:41.910
Bee is awesome!

02:43.630 --> 02:45.280
We won!

03:00.120 --> 03:01.190
Haikuo.

03:03.560 --> 03:05.150
I regret it.

03:06.050 --> 03:07.140
Regret what?

03:10.910 --> 03:13.520
I shouldn't have let Xingchi go back.

03:17.990 --> 03:19.150
That year,

03:19.960 --> 03:21.079
when we came to Beijing,

03:22.790 --> 03:25.270
we made a promise on the train.

03:25.860 --> 03:27.530
We said we'd make it big in Beijing.

03:29.700 --> 03:31.900
If we couldn't make a name for ourselves,

03:31.960 --> 03:33.590
we'd never go back.

03:34.350 --> 03:35.820
That's what we agreed on.

03:36.250 --> 03:37.970
The four of us together.

03:39.079 --> 03:40.810
But that bastard...

03:40.910 --> 03:42.690
He ran away again!

03:43.640 --> 03:44.940
He's tired.

03:45.490 --> 03:46.860
Who isn't tired?

03:48.700 --> 03:49.740
Aren't you tired?

03:49.770 --> 03:50.890
Am I not tired?

03:51.710 --> 03:52.910
Why is he the only one who's vulnerable?

03:52.910 --> 03:54.960
Why is he the only one who can't take hardship?

03:57.250 --> 03:58.370
Alright, alright.

04:07.130 --> 04:08.890
Tell Xingchi

04:09.420 --> 04:11.340
he can take a break for a while,

04:11.470 --> 04:12.520
six months at most.

04:13.480 --> 04:16.060
After that, he must get his ass back here.

04:17.360 --> 04:20.209
I'll save a position for him before we go public.

04:20.240 --> 04:21.740
After we go public,

04:25.850 --> 04:27.570
regulations will be stricter.

04:28.010 --> 04:30.250
I won't be able to pull strings anymore.

04:32.070 --> 04:33.320
You tell him.

04:35.250 --> 04:37.210
Why don't you tell him yourself?

04:37.750 --> 04:40.460
No, I won't talk to him.

04:41.280 --> 04:42.720
I'm a leader.

04:43.820 --> 04:45.480
He's just a small fry.

04:45.850 --> 04:48.520
What right does he have to talk to me directly?

04:54.530 --> 04:55.870
That bastard.

04:56.290 --> 04:59.730
He keeps pissing me off.

04:59.760 --> 05:01.410
I want to tell him, but I know he wouldn't listen.

05:03.310 --> 05:05.560
Forget it. Forget it.

05:07.120 --> 05:07.800
Let's drink.

05:08.680 --> 05:10.760
Stop drinking. You've had too much.

05:11.980 --> 05:13.140
Last drink, okay?

05:14.540 --> 05:15.270
Haikuo.

05:18.210 --> 05:19.510
Here's to us.

05:20.240 --> 05:22.710
The big talk we made when we were kids

05:23.720 --> 05:24.870
has become reality!

05:25.450 --> 05:26.250
Cheers!

05:30.000 --> 05:30.840
Mr. Qiu!

05:31.310 --> 05:32.110
Cheers!

05:32.980 --> 05:33.650
Come on!

05:34.200 --> 05:34.970
Come on!

05:35.520 --> 05:36.520
Cheers!

05:37.940 --> 05:38.940
Cheers!

05:46.010 --> 05:47.780
We won!

05:49.140 --> 05:51.130
We won!

05:56.710 --> 05:57.470
Be careful.

06:01.890 --> 06:02.900
Ms. Xia.

06:03.450 --> 06:04.520
I, I, I...

06:04.550 --> 06:07.040
I've been feeling very uneasy and anxious.

06:07.060 --> 06:08.950
Did you not sleep well last night?

06:08.970 --> 06:11.420
Maybe, I don't know.

06:11.940 --> 06:13.830
I... I've been calling him all morning,

06:13.830 --> 06:15.100
but Tianming hasn't answered.

06:15.120 --> 06:16.360
Let's go inside first and try calling him again.

06:18.510 --> 06:19.610
Come on.

06:19.750 --> 06:21.250
Please understand.

06:23.450 --> 06:25.600
I'm almost there. I'm already on my way.

06:26.480 --> 06:27.480
Please wait a bit longer.

06:30.050 --> 06:31.060
I'm sorry. I...

06:55.870 --> 06:56.560
Wanghe!

06:57.190 --> 06:57.800
Wanghe!

06:57.800 --> 06:59.159
Wake up, wake up!

06:59.180 --> 06:59.950
Wanghe!

07:02.570 --> 07:03.510
Wake up!

07:04.460 --> 07:05.580
Are you crazy?

07:05.600 --> 07:07.420
Fenghua called. Something really bad happened!

07:09.740 --> 07:11.250
Tianming!

07:13.810 --> 07:15.480
Tianming!

07:18.070 --> 07:19.870
Tianming!

07:20.240 --> 07:21.000
Wait.

07:21.020 --> 07:21.920
Wait!

07:26.280 --> 07:28.210
Tianming...

07:54.040 --> 07:54.830
Family members, please come in.

07:54.860 --> 07:56.050
Others, please stay back.

07:56.080 --> 07:57.050
Tianming!

08:19.320 --> 08:20.680
He Tianming

08:21.270 --> 08:23.050
has a 70-year-old mother

08:23.660 --> 08:25.190
and two children,

08:25.560 --> 08:27.420
with one still in the womb.

08:27.930 --> 08:29.600
When I entrusted him to you,

08:29.600 --> 08:32.890
you promised me you'd take good care of him.

08:33.390 --> 08:35.320
And now? What happened to him?

08:35.320 --> 08:36.200
Fenghua.

08:38.799 --> 08:40.080
It was an accident.

08:41.570 --> 08:43.130
No one wanted this to happen.

08:50.250 --> 08:51.840
Wasn't He Tianming the station chief?

08:52.990 --> 08:54.310
Why did he go out to deliver orders?

08:57.060 --> 08:58.200
There's been heavy rain these past few days,

08:58.220 --> 08:59.310
and it caused a surge in orders.

09:00.310 --> 09:01.600
He wanted to lend a hand.

09:02.660 --> 09:03.920
When there's a surge in orders,

09:04.240 --> 09:05.940
what penalties does the company have?

09:07.840 --> 09:09.260
Say it!

09:10.910 --> 09:12.220
There are indeed penalties,

09:13.250 --> 09:14.310
but there are also rewards.

09:14.390 --> 09:16.000
I'm asking you,

09:16.840 --> 09:19.030
what penalties does the company have?

09:19.970 --> 09:21.310
If standards aren't met,

09:22.450 --> 09:23.240
there's a fine.

09:31.740 --> 09:32.530
Fenghua.

09:36.610 --> 09:38.100
I'll find a way

09:38.300 --> 09:41.030
to apply for the maximum compensation for He.

09:44.010 --> 09:45.190
That's a man's life.

09:46.160 --> 09:47.280
How much do you want to compensate him?

09:48.930 --> 09:49.480
I...

09:49.500 --> 09:50.540
I don't know.

09:51.230 --> 09:52.780
The company has regulations in place for this.

09:52.840 --> 09:54.200
Regulations, regulations!

09:56.360 --> 09:58.690
Tell me, how much is your life worth?

09:59.750 --> 10:00.360
I'll pay.

10:04.810 --> 10:05.600
Fenghua.

10:17.910 --> 10:18.670
30,000?

10:19.200 --> 10:20.290
It was 20,000 before.

10:20.320 --> 10:21.830
I discussed it with the legal department,

10:21.850 --> 10:23.580
and we'll make an exception this time.

10:23.880 --> 10:26.130
After all, there are millions of delivery riders.

10:26.240 --> 10:28.020
If we paid a lot for every accident,

10:28.050 --> 10:29.580
how could we continue our business in the future?

10:30.340 --> 10:31.650
He was the station chief.

10:33.480 --> 10:34.840
But the company didn't require

10:34.840 --> 10:36.660
him to deliver orders.

10:36.890 --> 10:38.520
That was his personal choice.

10:38.550 --> 10:40.710
The company isn't legally responsible.

10:43.450 --> 10:44.170
Mr. Meng.

10:46.460 --> 10:47.780
That was a man's life.

10:48.060 --> 10:50.140
He had elderly parents and young children to support.

10:50.290 --> 10:52.730
His wife is even still pregnant.

10:52.850 --> 10:55.440
Our company must take a proactive approach to this matter.

11:00.450 --> 11:02.780
What's a proactive approach?

11:03.840 --> 11:04.870
One person dies,

11:05.110 --> 11:06.190
and we pay millions in compensation?

11:06.560 --> 11:08.380
Or are you suggesting

11:08.480 --> 11:10.230
the company should support his wife and children?

11:10.480 --> 11:11.760
If that's the case,

11:11.840 --> 11:13.200
we might as well quit the food delivery business.

11:13.510 --> 11:14.410
We might as well open

11:14.440 --> 11:15.840
a kindergarten or nursing home, that'll do.

11:19.980 --> 11:20.690
Mr. Meng.

11:22.380 --> 11:24.530
I formally request

11:25.520 --> 11:26.690
a significant increase in

11:26.720 --> 11:28.080
He Tianming's compensation amount.

11:31.570 --> 11:32.910
This matter is not under my jurisdiction.

11:33.190 --> 11:34.680
You should go talk to the legal department.

11:36.720 --> 11:37.320
Okay.

11:46.650 --> 11:48.420
30,000 yuan for a man's life,

11:48.480 --> 11:49.530
do you think that's reasonable?

11:49.600 --> 11:50.270
Mr. Xie.

11:50.360 --> 11:51.090
Please calm down first.

11:51.120 --> 11:52.410
I can't help it!

11:52.510 --> 11:53.240
Listen to me.

11:53.260 --> 11:54.030
No one wants

11:54.050 --> 11:55.290
this kind of accident to happen.

11:55.360 --> 11:55.960
That's why

11:55.960 --> 11:57.150
our company has purchased accident insurance

11:57.150 --> 11:58.340
for every employee.

11:58.390 --> 11:59.760
However, the specific amount of compensation

11:59.810 --> 12:01.000
shall be determined in accordance with the company's regulations.

12:01.030 --> 12:02.080
This is no exception.

12:02.240 --> 12:03.340
The accident insurance

12:03.720 --> 12:05.860
is deducted from each delivery rider's salary,

12:06.000 --> 12:06.810
three yuan per day,

12:06.840 --> 12:07.450
right?

12:07.480 --> 12:07.960
Yes.

12:08.030 --> 12:09.960
So what has the company done for the employees?

12:09.980 --> 12:11.150
The company has provided them with

12:11.150 --> 12:12.390
a better platform

12:12.390 --> 12:13.480
so they can work hard

12:13.480 --> 12:14.480
and earn money to support their families, right?

12:14.510 --> 12:15.440
We're all colleagues.

12:15.480 --> 12:17.480
Cut out the official jargon, okay?

12:17.720 --> 12:20.030
Just tell me how much compensation we can give him!

12:20.050 --> 12:20.450
Mr. Xie.

12:20.480 --> 12:21.780
I've already said,

12:21.840 --> 12:24.050
it has to be determined according to the company's regulations.

12:24.080 --> 12:24.940
Unless you tell me

12:24.970 --> 12:26.470
Mr. Meng has given different instructions.

12:30.540 --> 12:31.990
He asked me to talk to you,

12:32.040 --> 12:33.570
and you're telling me to go back to him?

12:33.590 --> 12:34.960
With your buck-passing skills,

12:35.120 --> 12:36.710
you should be playing in the World Cup!

12:37.260 --> 12:39.330
I'm just an employee here too.

12:45.120 --> 12:46.270
After He's accident,

12:47.630 --> 12:49.320
all the delivery riders are watching.

12:49.720 --> 12:51.700
He was trying to boost the company's performance

12:51.840 --> 12:52.850
when the accident happened.

12:53.030 --> 12:54.750
If such a dedicated employee

12:54.840 --> 12:56.170
couldn't get a satisfying compensation,

12:56.360 --> 12:57.720
who would be willing to work hard

12:57.720 --> 12:59.090
and strive for the company in the future?

13:00.480 --> 13:02.600
I don't know whether He worked hard or not,

13:03.480 --> 13:05.670
but based on the current evidence,

13:06.120 --> 13:07.390
He's accident this time

13:07.510 --> 13:09.220
was caused by him running a red light.

13:12.090 --> 13:12.930
Come on, Mr. Xie.

13:13.860 --> 13:14.930
Look at this, Mr. Xie.

13:15.480 --> 13:16.360
This is what

13:16.390 --> 13:17.480
the street cameras captured that day.

13:17.510 --> 13:19.070
The traffic light at this intersection

13:19.240 --> 13:20.000
was changing.

13:20.150 --> 13:22.150
He wanted to speed through,

13:22.240 --> 13:23.570
and an SUV was coming from this side.

13:22.300 --> 13:25.560
[Street]

13:23.710 --> 13:25.680
That's why the accident happened.

13:25.840 --> 13:28.270
So He should bear the primary responsibility.

13:28.290 --> 13:29.200
In this light,

13:29.220 --> 13:30.460
the insurance company's compensation amount

13:30.510 --> 13:31.720
will be even more limited.

13:31.750 --> 13:32.910
But as for the specific number,

13:32.930 --> 13:34.620
we'll have to wait for the insurance company's reply.

13:34.650 --> 13:35.970
Only then will we know.

14:07.350 --> 14:08.110
How much do you think

14:08.150 --> 14:10.660
the company will compensate that delivery rider?

14:11.010 --> 14:12.340
They won't compensate much.

14:12.440 --> 14:13.320
It was a traffic accident,

14:13.360 --> 14:14.590
not the company's fault.

14:15.250 --> 14:16.120
If everyone

14:16.150 --> 14:17.960
could get a lot of compensation in situations like this,

14:18.030 --> 14:20.030
how big of a company could afford such compensation?

14:20.050 --> 14:20.890
That's true.

14:21.480 --> 14:22.030
Let's go.

14:22.120 --> 14:22.750
Let's go.

14:43.030 --> 14:44.080
Have some water.

14:50.080 --> 14:51.480
Tianming is gone.

14:53.000 --> 14:54.240
For the sake of your two children,

14:54.870 --> 14:56.030
you can't fall apart.

15:13.120 --> 15:13.850
Have you told

15:15.500 --> 15:16.770
his mother about this?

15:21.120 --> 15:22.120
Don't drag on for too long.

15:23.120 --> 15:24.340
Before the cremation,

15:25.030 --> 15:26.390
she should at least see him one last time.

15:30.030 --> 15:31.570
I don't dare to tell her.

15:34.680 --> 15:35.870
She's too old.

15:36.260 --> 15:37.350
She won't be able to handle it.

15:38.280 --> 15:39.770
I'm all alone.

15:41.140 --> 15:42.370
You still have me.

15:43.270 --> 15:44.760
There are still many things

15:45.030 --> 15:45.910
we'll need to deal with together.

15:47.150 --> 15:48.520
What things?

15:49.120 --> 15:50.120
We need to fight for his rights.

15:52.000 --> 15:53.240
We must seek justice for Tianming's death.

15:54.380 --> 15:55.980
Bee exploits its employees like this.

15:56.750 --> 15:58.270
They must be held accountable.

16:00.330 --> 16:01.850
You're willing to help me?

16:05.360 --> 16:07.000
Tianming used to work for me.

16:08.120 --> 16:09.350
You and his mother

16:09.510 --> 16:10.770
are also my people.

16:11.960 --> 16:13.760
It's all my fault!

16:13.870 --> 16:14.900
What are you doing?

16:15.630 --> 16:17.270
If I hadn't pushed him,

16:17.550 --> 16:20.100
Tianming wouldn't have ended up like this!

16:23.150 --> 16:24.390
It's all my fault!

16:27.960 --> 16:29.380
It's not your fault.

16:31.160 --> 16:32.100
Don't you feel guilty.

16:32.120 --> 16:33.260
It's not your fault.

16:51.410 --> 16:53.810
[Haikuo]

19:15.310 --> 19:18.670
[Haikuo]

19:20.830 --> 19:21.600
[Haikuo]

19:23.530 --> 19:24.290
Hello?

19:25.480 --> 19:26.240
Why aren't you answering your phone?

19:26.270 --> 19:26.880
Are you okay?

19:27.000 --> 19:28.440
I called you more than a dozen times, but you didn't answer.

19:29.030 --> 19:29.790
I'm okay.

19:30.640 --> 19:31.710
I'm just lying in bed.

19:33.720 --> 19:35.350
What's wrong? Did you catch a cold?

19:35.480 --> 19:36.810
Why is your voice so nasal?

19:41.000 --> 19:41.480
Hello?

19:43.400 --> 19:43.880
Hello?

20:03.730 --> 20:04.730
Why are you here...

20:07.720 --> 20:08.270
Get up.

20:11.790 --> 20:12.500
Come on.

20:15.030 --> 20:16.020
You're burning up.

20:17.160 --> 20:18.330
Have you taken any medicine?

20:20.720 --> 20:22.060
I'll go buy some medicine for you.

20:22.300 --> 20:23.020
No need.

20:25.360 --> 20:26.730
I'll be fine after lying down for a while.

20:27.480 --> 20:28.640
Let go of my hand first.

20:28.720 --> 20:30.180
I'll get you a glass of water, okay?

20:31.110 --> 20:31.950
Don't leave.

20:37.110 --> 20:38.160
I was wrong.

20:38.880 --> 20:39.440
What?

20:41.070 --> 20:42.350
Xingchi left.

20:44.030 --> 20:45.110
And He died.

20:47.310 --> 20:48.550
You entrusted him to me,

20:49.550 --> 20:50.840
and he ended up dead.

20:52.630 --> 20:55.170
I know you all blame me.

20:56.640 --> 20:58.000
Everyone blames me.

20:59.560 --> 21:01.490
But that was my responsibility.

21:02.480 --> 21:04.810
I had to boost the performance.

21:06.110 --> 21:07.480
I had to win.

21:09.210 --> 21:10.900
I must win.

21:14.400 --> 21:16.200
You chose this responsibility.

21:17.430 --> 21:18.780
You had no choice.

21:19.730 --> 21:20.450
Fenghua.

21:23.830 --> 21:24.860
I was wrong.

21:26.530 --> 21:28.210
I know I was wrong.

21:30.330 --> 21:32.130
Please don't be angry, okay?

21:35.550 --> 21:37.000
I didn't mean for things to turn out this way.

21:38.550 --> 21:39.910
Don't be angry.

24:04.700 --> 24:08.560
[I'm leaving. Remember to take your medicine. Take care of yourself.]

24:37.800 --> 24:39.020
-Mr. Xie.
-Mr. Xie.

24:45.810 --> 24:46.540
Chief.

24:46.680 --> 24:48.420
Here's the list of delivery riders who have resigned in the past few days.

24:50.010 --> 24:51.390
Why are there so many?

24:52.310 --> 24:53.310
What's going on?

24:53.410 --> 24:55.130
Since Chief He's incident,

24:55.150 --> 24:56.560
everyone's morale has been low.

24:55.460 --> 24:59.810
[Office]

24:58.270 --> 24:59.090
Mr. Xie.

24:59.120 --> 24:59.720
Hello, Mr. Xie.

24:59.750 --> 25:00.790
I'm Liu, the temporary chief

25:01.000 --> 25:02.450
who just got transferred here.

25:08.630 --> 25:09.980
I'd like to see

25:10.640 --> 25:13.070
the data of Station 203 before He's incident.

25:17.280 --> 25:18.040
Mr. Xie.

25:18.850 --> 25:21.090
After He Tianming took over Station 203,

25:21.150 --> 25:22.590
the data improved rapidly.

25:22.640 --> 25:24.640
Especially in the three days before his incident,

25:24.660 --> 25:27.080
the order volume increased by 15% compared to usual.

25:27.100 --> 25:29.520
I heard he required full attendance from all staff at the station,

25:29.890 --> 25:31.410
and there were indeed no

25:31.510 --> 25:32.560
leave requests.

25:32.680 --> 25:33.450
Their station

25:33.510 --> 25:34.990
was also the one among all stations in Beijing

25:35.030 --> 25:36.190
with the lowest order cancellation rate.

25:37.400 --> 25:38.580
Chief He did this

25:38.680 --> 25:40.240
because he followed the instructions from the higher-ups.

25:40.260 --> 25:41.690
Everyone was working overtime,

25:41.720 --> 25:42.730
pushing themselves really hard.

25:42.880 --> 25:43.840
The performance was great,

25:43.860 --> 25:46.250
and at the celebration, you were all drinking champagne

25:46.280 --> 25:47.010
and whatnot...

25:47.030 --> 25:48.890
Now, such an accident happened,

25:49.480 --> 25:51.030
but the company hasn't done anything in response.

25:51.790 --> 25:52.660
How nice.

25:52.720 --> 25:53.830
Watch your words.

25:55.560 --> 25:56.700
You're not wrong.

25:57.350 --> 25:58.270
Go on.

25:58.350 --> 25:59.160
What is there to say?

25:59.180 --> 26:00.650
There's nothing to say.

26:01.100 --> 26:02.260
He already died.

26:02.720 --> 26:03.650
Mr. Xie.

26:03.920 --> 26:05.920
I've been working at Station 203 for a long time.

26:06.060 --> 26:07.750
Let me report to you on our work.

26:07.880 --> 26:09.570
Since Chief He's accident,

26:09.600 --> 26:10.750
over 20 delivery riders have resigned...

26:10.750 --> 26:11.630
Xiaofei!

26:13.500 --> 26:14.570
Where did they go?

26:14.720 --> 26:16.900
Anywhere is better than here.

26:17.030 --> 26:18.370
Our chief had an accident,

26:18.480 --> 26:19.510
yet the company didn't even show any concern.

26:19.540 --> 26:21.460
Not to mention us delivery riders at the bottom.

26:21.720 --> 26:23.420
The company used to make big promises,

26:23.480 --> 26:24.760
and everyone was happy to buy them.

26:24.880 --> 26:26.810
Now everyone's disillusioned.

26:27.030 --> 26:29.240
Even if you laid out a grand feast,

26:30.000 --> 26:31.310
no one would dare to eat it now.

26:32.240 --> 26:33.190
Tianming!

26:34.120 --> 26:35.120
Where's Tianming?

26:37.720 --> 26:38.450
Xiaofei?

26:38.480 --> 26:39.430
Auntie.

26:39.640 --> 26:40.640
Where's Tianming?

26:40.750 --> 26:41.510
Auntie.

26:42.270 --> 26:43.720
I know he's been busy these days.

26:43.880 --> 26:44.880
The weather's getting cold,

26:45.000 --> 26:46.620
so I brought him some clothes.

26:46.720 --> 26:47.480
Where is he...

26:50.780 --> 26:52.060
What's going on?

26:56.160 --> 26:57.630
Has something happened to Tianming?

26:58.500 --> 27:00.560
Tell me, has something happened to Tianming?

27:00.580 --> 27:01.960
Why haven't I seen him?

27:02.000 --> 27:02.710
Auntie.

27:03.750 --> 27:04.770
Mr. Xie.

27:04.820 --> 27:05.350
Auntie.

27:05.350 --> 27:06.350
Mr. Xie!

27:06.380 --> 27:07.740
Where's my Tianming?

27:07.980 --> 27:09.870
Why haven't I seen him since I came in?

27:09.920 --> 27:11.350
Has something happened to him?

27:11.950 --> 27:13.590
I knew something was off with my daughter-in-law these days.

27:13.610 --> 27:14.720
She's been so evasive.

27:14.720 --> 27:16.200
I felt something wasn't right.

27:16.260 --> 27:17.720
Tell me, where's Tianming?

27:17.720 --> 27:18.710
Where's Tianming?

27:18.740 --> 27:20.200
Has something happened to him?

27:20.240 --> 27:21.400
Tell me, please!

27:21.480 --> 27:23.200
Tell me already!

27:23.240 --> 27:24.480
I'm his mother. Whatever it is,

27:24.480 --> 27:25.630
I can handle it for him.

27:25.720 --> 27:27.310
Please tell me.

27:27.630 --> 27:28.460
Auntie.

27:31.350 --> 27:32.560
There was a heavy rainstorm a couple of days ago.

27:34.830 --> 27:36.160
He had a car accident.

27:40.030 --> 27:40.680
Auntie!

27:40.680 --> 27:42.310
-Auntie.
-Auntie.

27:42.600 --> 27:43.610
Come help quickly!

27:45.550 --> 27:46.610
Get a chair!

27:48.170 --> 27:48.950
Auntie!

27:49.270 --> 27:49.950
Auntie!

27:51.010 --> 27:52.850
My son!

27:52.920 --> 27:54.960
My son!

27:55.000 --> 27:59.790
My son! My dear son!

28:12.860 --> 28:13.610
Where are you?

28:22.550 --> 28:24.330
All your stuff is in the box.

28:24.620 --> 28:26.400
Clothes, miscellaneous items, and such.

28:28.000 --> 28:28.750
Thank you.

28:32.220 --> 28:33.920
I'm moving next month.

28:36.360 --> 28:37.620
To Xinghe Bay.

28:49.980 --> 28:51.420
If anything comes up, let's keep in touch on WeChat.

28:57.750 --> 28:59.010
If

29:00.590 --> 29:02.370
I had agreed to buy a house back then,

29:03.640 --> 29:04.510
would you still have chosen to leave?

29:13.400 --> 29:14.160
I probably would.

29:16.150 --> 29:18.190
So it wasn't entirely because of the house, right?

29:18.640 --> 29:19.350
Not entirely.

29:21.550 --> 29:22.720
You

29:24.510 --> 29:26.310
are actually quite conflicted within.

29:26.860 --> 29:28.400
Being with you

29:28.880 --> 29:30.030
is actually quite exhausting.

29:31.510 --> 29:33.040
After your parents separated,

29:33.770 --> 29:36.000
on one hand, you crave a peaceful life,

29:36.550 --> 29:37.350
but on the other hand,

29:37.400 --> 29:38.700
you worry

29:38.920 --> 29:40.350
that you'll get tired of such a life

29:40.400 --> 29:41.400
and want to escape.

29:41.790 --> 29:43.220
So you're very confused.

29:44.160 --> 29:46.120
You don't know what to choose.

29:52.110 --> 29:52.830
It might be true.

29:58.690 --> 30:00.020
You're a programmer,

30:00.790 --> 30:02.370
rational and logical.

30:02.890 --> 30:04.010
That's not good.

30:04.680 --> 30:05.550
I hope

30:06.430 --> 30:08.590
you will ask your heart more often in the future.

30:08.720 --> 30:10.410
What do you really want?

30:11.590 --> 30:12.520
How should you live your life

30:12.550 --> 30:13.880
so that you feel

30:13.880 --> 30:15.110
comfortable and satisfied?

30:21.680 --> 30:22.510
Well,

30:26.550 --> 30:27.270
goodbye then.

31:13.440 --> 31:14.200
Wanghe.

31:16.880 --> 31:18.590
Do you think I'm a conflicted person?

31:19.640 --> 31:20.830
You met with Xiaohui?

31:23.310 --> 31:24.350
Your chat with her made you feel depressed?

31:29.110 --> 31:30.310
She said

31:32.000 --> 31:33.200
I lived a very conflicted life.

31:34.990 --> 31:36.470
I didn't agree at the time,

31:36.550 --> 31:38.120
but I couldn't be bothered to argue with her.

31:38.830 --> 31:40.330
On the way back,

31:41.310 --> 31:42.510
the more I thought about it, the more insecure I felt.

31:43.550 --> 31:44.630
She wasn't wrong.

31:45.940 --> 31:46.950
I, as a person,

31:47.200 --> 31:48.270
am indeed very conflicted.

31:48.920 --> 31:50.050
I think

31:50.920 --> 31:52.350
you've been brainwashed by her.

31:53.440 --> 31:54.000
No.

31:59.240 --> 32:00.710
I've been like this since I was little.

32:02.400 --> 32:03.680
In my senior year of high school,

32:04.160 --> 32:06.670
I actually wanted to get into Shanghai Jiaotong University.

32:08.880 --> 32:10.070
The computer science major there

32:10.110 --> 32:11.350
has a better scientific research atmosphere.

32:12.790 --> 32:14.700
But you all wanted to come to Beijing.

32:15.880 --> 32:16.750
I thought,

32:17.070 --> 32:18.280
it would also be good

32:18.310 --> 32:18.960
for us to stick together.

32:19.780 --> 32:21.430
So I came here afterwards.

32:25.200 --> 32:26.270
But sometimes I do wonder,

32:28.580 --> 32:30.510
if I had gone to Shanghai Jiaotong University back then,

32:31.110 --> 32:32.240
would things have been different?

32:38.720 --> 32:40.950
No matter what choices I make in this life,

32:41.560 --> 32:42.730
I always feel conflicted.

32:45.410 --> 32:46.680
I'm always anxious about gains and losses.

32:47.160 --> 32:48.160
Including my relationship with Xiaohui.

32:51.400 --> 32:52.160
Haikuo.

32:54.590 --> 32:55.640
You two broke up

32:57.070 --> 32:58.280
because she cheated.

32:59.400 --> 33:00.400
It wasn't your fault.

33:01.230 --> 33:01.800
I know.

33:03.860 --> 33:05.320
But I still feel guilty.

33:08.550 --> 33:10.380
I really admire my mom in this aspect.

33:12.920 --> 33:14.170
Once she made a decision,

33:14.310 --> 33:15.520
she'd move forward bravely

33:15.550 --> 33:16.350
and never regret it.

33:19.440 --> 33:21.050
Today, Xiaohui also advised me

33:22.200 --> 33:23.750
to ask myself

33:25.040 --> 33:25.830
what kind of life

33:25.880 --> 33:27.880
I really want to live in the future.

33:30.640 --> 33:32.110
I've been thinking about it until now,

33:33.890 --> 33:35.290
but I have no clue.

33:36.510 --> 33:38.640
If you can't figure it out, don't think about it for now.

33:40.310 --> 33:41.510
Just take it one step at a time.

33:45.960 --> 33:46.690
Wanghe.

33:51.310 --> 33:54.350
There's one thing I've decided.

33:55.790 --> 33:56.680
Bee

33:57.640 --> 33:58.480
is not suitable for me.

34:00.330 --> 34:01.230
What do you mean?

34:02.920 --> 34:03.920
You want to resign?

34:21.000 --> 34:22.150
Xingchi left.

34:23.469 --> 34:25.179
Fenghua had a falling out with me

34:25.440 --> 34:26.670
because of He's accident.

34:28.150 --> 34:29.030
And now,

34:31.070 --> 34:32.030
you're leaving too?

34:36.400 --> 34:38.320
From the company's attitude towards He's accident this time,

34:38.320 --> 34:39.400
you can see that

34:39.929 --> 34:42.020
Bee is a company with a wolf culture.

34:42.860 --> 34:44.030
Those at the front eat meat,

34:45.409 --> 34:46.440
while those at the back,

34:47.070 --> 34:47.710
die.

34:49.010 --> 34:50.070
I'm not a wolf,

34:51.560 --> 34:52.690
and I don't want to be one.

35:12.000 --> 35:13.510
Tianming was too careless.

35:15.300 --> 35:16.430
What?

35:18.280 --> 35:20.680
The labor contract he signed with Bee

35:20.710 --> 35:21.850
has very harsh conditionality.

35:22.550 --> 35:25.200
The parts involving compensation clauses

35:25.230 --> 35:26.380
are all vague.

35:26.550 --> 35:27.850
It's particularly unfavorable to him.

35:28.070 --> 35:29.860
Isn't this a standard contract?

35:30.320 --> 35:31.420
Everyone signs it like this.

35:32.180 --> 35:34.620
The contracts for our station were all revised by me.

35:34.760 --> 35:36.520
I argued with the head office for a long time

35:36.550 --> 35:38.550
and finally settled on them after much discussion.

35:38.840 --> 35:39.560
Even so,

35:39.710 --> 35:41.640
I wanted to spend money on additional insurance back then,

35:41.710 --> 35:42.980
but nobody supported it.

35:44.890 --> 35:47.340
Everyone thought they wouldn't be so unlucky,

35:47.590 --> 35:49.150
and nothing would happen to them.

35:50.320 --> 35:51.690
With this contract of his,

35:52.070 --> 35:53.280
if it comes to a lawsuit,

35:54.630 --> 35:56.030
we don't have any advantage at all.

35:58.760 --> 35:59.860
What should we do then?

36:02.830 --> 36:04.350
Come on, tell us, what should we do?

36:06.920 --> 36:08.840
If you trust me,

36:09.360 --> 36:11.060
give Wanghe a little more time.

36:11.190 --> 36:12.510
I believe he is sincere

36:12.550 --> 36:13.850
in wanting to handle this matter well.

36:15.030 --> 36:16.610
What if he can't handle it well?

36:17.540 --> 36:18.210
What if he...

36:18.480 --> 36:20.480
What if he wants to protect himself

36:20.560 --> 36:21.970
with total disregard for Tianming's interests?

36:22.000 --> 36:22.950
What should we do then?

36:23.230 --> 36:25.020
Just give him a bit more time.

36:25.320 --> 36:26.600
If he really can't handle it well,

36:26.710 --> 36:27.890
I'll step in.

36:28.030 --> 36:30.110
I'll cover the legal fees.

36:30.360 --> 36:31.010
As for the lawyer,

36:31.070 --> 36:32.460
I've also found the most suitable one.

36:32.490 --> 36:34.550
The one who helped me with labor disputes before.

36:34.840 --> 36:36.690
Please trust Wanghe's character.

36:36.760 --> 36:38.880
He has never hurt anyone since childhood.

36:38.910 --> 36:39.670
So you can rest assured.

36:39.670 --> 36:41.640
How can I possibly rest assured?

36:42.630 --> 36:44.380
You two are childhood friends.

36:44.410 --> 36:45.280
If it really comes down to it,

36:45.320 --> 36:47.030
how can you possibly stand on our side?

36:47.060 --> 36:47.850
Stop it.

36:47.940 --> 36:48.560
Stop it.

36:51.670 --> 36:52.400
Mom.

36:53.360 --> 36:54.880
I used to listen to you in everything,

36:55.850 --> 36:57.080
but not this time.

36:58.020 --> 36:59.230
Tianming has passed away.

36:59.850 --> 37:01.530
With so many troubles at home,

37:01.560 --> 37:03.040
and the children are still so young,

37:03.550 --> 37:04.960
how can I possibly put all my hopes

37:04.980 --> 37:06.900
on the two of them?

37:10.550 --> 37:11.230
Fenghua.

37:12.550 --> 37:14.030
I know you're a righteous and responsible person.

37:14.770 --> 37:16.240
You have a kind heart.

37:16.260 --> 37:18.280
You've also done a lot for our family.

37:18.610 --> 37:19.850
I appreciate your kindness.

37:21.850 --> 37:24.130
But I must seek justice for Tianming's death.

37:24.490 --> 37:26.140
Even if I have to risk my life,

37:26.170 --> 37:27.980
I won't let them off the hook!

37:29.680 --> 37:30.550
Lirong.

37:30.760 --> 37:31.490
Lirong.

37:31.620 --> 37:32.500
Lirong!

37:34.010 --> 37:37.090
[Beijing Haidian Kejing Garden]

37:42.820 --> 37:43.630
No!

37:43.670 --> 37:44.410
Stop!

37:45.710 --> 37:46.880
What's going on here?

37:45.980 --> 37:47.050
[R.I.P.]

37:49.880 --> 37:51.420
Give my son back!

37:51.230 --> 37:51.940
[R.I.P.]

37:54.070 --> 37:55.400
Mom!

37:59.060 --> 38:01.630
My son is gone!

38:01.650 --> 38:02.520
Hey.

38:02.800 --> 38:03.540
You two.

38:03.670 --> 38:05.550
Whatever this is for, can't we talk in the office?

38:05.550 --> 38:07.110
Why should I talk to you?

38:07.110 --> 38:09.110
Get your boss here!

38:09.110 --> 38:10.000
Watch your tone.

38:10.000 --> 38:11.090
This is Mr. Song.

38:11.230 --> 38:12.350
Mr. Song, is it?

38:12.630 --> 38:14.260
What do you want to do?

38:14.280 --> 38:15.420
No, no, no.

38:16.440 --> 38:17.820
The boss you're referring to,

38:17.850 --> 38:19.840
is it the head of Haidian operations?

38:19.860 --> 38:22.860
Whoever is responsible for Tianming, that's who I'm looking for.

38:23.240 --> 38:24.900
If you don't take responsibility,

38:24.920 --> 38:26.190
I'll die here today!

38:26.190 --> 38:27.260
Me too!

38:33.270 --> 38:34.450
Don't go too far.

38:34.480 --> 38:35.740
Get out of my way!

38:35.840 --> 38:36.640
Remember,

38:36.670 --> 38:38.380
no physical conflicts allowed!

38:38.800 --> 38:39.580
Got it.

38:39.710 --> 38:41.480
I want to see your boss!

38:41.630 --> 38:43.400
I want to see your boss!

38:52.940 --> 38:53.950
What are you all doing?

38:55.690 --> 38:56.590
It's no big deal.

39:03.920 --> 39:04.870
Why are you panicking?

39:07.220 --> 39:08.840
I'm here, aren't I?

39:09.320 --> 39:10.510
All these years,

39:10.590 --> 39:12.370
what haven't we been able to overcome?

39:12.720 --> 39:14.040
Listen up, everyone.

39:14.510 --> 39:16.380
Before this matter is resolved,

39:16.670 --> 39:19.360
no one is allowed to post anything on Weibo

39:19.400 --> 39:20.500
or WeChat Moments!

39:26.580 --> 39:27.350
Brother-in-law.

39:31.800 --> 39:33.970
Brother-in-law, you see?

39:33.990 --> 39:35.360
What a mess

39:35.360 --> 39:36.190
they've caused in the company.

39:36.190 --> 39:37.110
We can't let them keep causing trouble like this.

39:37.110 --> 39:38.550
Otherwise, the impact will be too negative.

39:38.550 --> 39:39.800
Why should you be worried?

39:40.960 --> 39:42.970
Who they want to see is Xie Wanghe.

39:43.440 --> 39:44.320
Besides,

39:45.230 --> 39:46.670
the bigger this gets, the better.

39:47.410 --> 39:48.250
Anyway,

39:50.230 --> 39:52.090
we won't be the ones taking the blame in the end.

39:53.240 --> 39:54.440
Brother-in-law.

39:54.630 --> 39:57.630
If this gets too big, it'll end badly for everyone.

40:00.550 --> 40:02.050
It all comes down to money.

40:02.330 --> 40:05.000
If money can solve it, it's not a problem.

40:05.110 --> 40:06.400
Brother-in-law, if this really blows up,

40:06.400 --> 40:08.000
Mr. Meng will definitely step in personally

40:08.030 --> 40:09.070
to protect Xie Wanghe.

40:10.890 --> 40:13.300
That depends on how big it gets.

40:16.290 --> 40:19.410
What if the situation gets so serious

40:19.780 --> 40:22.340
that Meng has to sacrifice a "rook" to save the "king"?

40:26.670 --> 40:28.790
Brother-in-law, I'll contact the media right now.

40:28.850 --> 40:29.460
Come back.

40:32.480 --> 40:33.720
No need to rush it.

40:34.150 --> 40:35.180
Let them continue to make a scene.

40:38.290 --> 40:40.460
Netizens will definitely take photos and post it on Weibo.

40:40.590 --> 40:41.700
Once this matter

40:41.800 --> 40:42.820
becomes a trending topic on Weibo,

40:43.350 --> 40:45.410
when Meng is out of options,

40:45.440 --> 40:47.250
we'll add fuel to the fire.

40:47.270 --> 40:49.250
Fan the flames a bit.

40:50.480 --> 40:53.760
This time, we'll let that brat Xie Wanghe

40:53.840 --> 40:56.350
spit out everything he took from us before.

40:57.340 --> 40:58.910
Every last bit of it.

41:05.290 --> 41:05.850
Brilliant.

41:07.800 --> 41:09.040
Absolutely brilliant.

41:09.690 --> 41:10.580
Brother-in-law.

41:11.250 --> 41:13.100
My sister couldn't have made a better choice when she chose you

41:13.150 --> 41:15.460
back then.

41:15.530 --> 41:18.370
What nonsense are you talking about?

41:19.550 --> 41:21.360
Brother-in-law, but I just told them

41:21.390 --> 41:23.140
not to post on Weibo

41:23.190 --> 41:24.550
or WeChat Moments.

41:24.550 --> 41:26.190
Was that a mistake?

41:27.680 --> 41:29.160
Can you possibly control all of that?

41:29.190 --> 41:30.220
If they want to post it, let them be.

41:30.630 --> 41:31.270
You're right.

41:31.730 --> 41:33.570
It's in human nature. The more you tell them not to post,

41:33.670 --> 41:35.190
the more likely they'll do it.

41:38.030 --> 41:39.480
Alright, get back to work.

41:39.990 --> 41:42.410
I'll make arrangements for tonight then.

41:42.950 --> 41:45.120
Don't worry. I won't let my sister know.

41:52.830 --> 41:54.610
You know He Tianming, right?

41:53.080 --> 41:57.490
[Fenghua Express]

41:54.740 --> 41:55.920
Yes, we were colleagues.

41:56.120 --> 41:57.630
Can you describe what kind of person he was?

41:57.630 --> 41:58.550
He was a nice person.

41:58.550 --> 42:00.190
We worked together every day.

42:00.210 --> 42:01.210
So you worked together...

42:01.240 --> 42:01.840
Yes.

42:01.840 --> 42:02.450
We

42:02.480 --> 42:03.740
all worked at this station.

42:03.910 --> 42:04.700
Is the work tiring?

42:05.040 --> 42:05.440
Yes, it's tiring.

42:05.440 --> 42:06.150
In our line of work,

42:06.190 --> 42:07.800
it's quite hard anyway.

42:07.800 --> 42:08.670
Fenghua.

42:09.430 --> 42:10.210
Who are they?

42:10.750 --> 42:11.730
Reporters.

42:14.490 --> 42:16.170
You're Ms. Xia, right?

42:17.310 --> 42:18.210
I am.

42:18.230 --> 42:20.080
Hello, we're reporters from Fellow Workers.com.

42:18.960 --> 42:22.340
[Fenghua Express Notice Board]

42:20.190 --> 42:21.120
We heard about what happened to He Tianming,

42:21.150 --> 42:22.190
and we're here for an interview.

42:22.400 --> 42:23.400
Who sent you here?

42:23.630 --> 42:25.000
We came on our own initiative.

42:25.150 --> 42:25.960
He Tianming's case

42:25.980 --> 42:27.430
isn't an isolated incident in the food delivery industry.

42:27.480 --> 42:28.630
So we wanted to use this opportunity

42:28.710 --> 42:30.480
to speak up for vulnerable groups.

42:31.110 --> 42:32.150
You're asking the wrong person.

42:32.150 --> 42:32.950
What we do is parcel delivery,

42:33.070 --> 42:33.590
not food delivery.

42:33.630 --> 42:34.480
Yes, I know.

42:34.590 --> 42:36.370
But he worked here before, right?

42:36.480 --> 42:38.550
And I heard you felt quite sorry when he left.

42:38.550 --> 42:40.440
So we want to ask what happened at that time.

42:40.480 --> 42:42.630
We're not at liberty to discuss matters related to the food delivery industry.

42:43.670 --> 42:44.630
From now on,

42:45.110 --> 42:46.490
without my permission,

42:46.630 --> 42:48.450
whoever gives an unauthorized interview

42:48.840 --> 42:50.480
will receive a serious demerit. Do you understand?

42:50.480 --> 42:51.420
Understood!

42:51.510 --> 42:52.150
Hello.

42:52.150 --> 42:53.590
Please leave. We are not accepting interviews anymore.

43:01.910 --> 43:02.730
Fenghua.

43:03.160 --> 43:03.910
Fenghua.

43:04.920 --> 43:05.910
Are you alright?

43:06.960 --> 43:07.600
I'm okay.
